1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:01,598
Scary movie...

2
00:00:01,598 --> 00:00:02,782
creepy music...

3
00:00:02,782 --> 00:00:04,464
and your arm does...

4
00:00:04,464 --> 00:00:05,562
this.

5
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:06,910
Congrats.

6
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:08,500
You're a plucked goose.

7
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:09,470
Hence...

8
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:10,500
goosebumps.

9
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:11,255
Each arm hair

10
00:00:11,255 --> 00:00:13,030
has its own tiny muscle.

11
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:13,669
Scared,

12
00:00:13,669 --> 00:00:14,502
or cold?

13
00:00:14,502 --> 00:00:16,040
Your nerves yank them

14
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,300
ALL at once.

15
00:00:17,342 --> 00:00:18,743
The hair stands up...

16
00:00:18,743 --> 00:00:19,901
and the skin bunches

17
00:00:19,901 --> 00:00:21,000
into a bump.

18
00:00:21,024 --> 00:00:22,340
For furry animals,

19
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,650
it's genius.

20
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,303
Fluffed fur

21
00:00:24,303 --> 00:00:25,667
traps warm air...

22
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,260
and makes a scared cat

23
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:27,890
look

24
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,333
HUGE.

25
00:00:29,439 --> 00:00:31,014
You lost the fur...

26
00:00:31,014 --> 00:00:32,467
but kept the button.

27
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,170
Even music can press it.

28
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,100
Scientists think

29
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,240
big emotions

30
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,267
trip the same old alarm.

31
00:00:38,297 --> 00:00:39,082
And some people

32
00:00:39,082 --> 00:00:40,270
can do it...

33
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,467
on command.

34
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:42,933
Show-offs.

35
00:00:42,985 --> 00:00:43,682
Next up:

36
00:00:43,682 --> 00:00:44,910
why your ears pop

37
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:46,010
on planes.

38
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:46,930
Subscribe...

39
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:48,310
on command.

